Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.98,0:00:06.62,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Soon...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.62,0:00:08.64,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Hurry up and come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.71,0:00:18.37,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.37,0:00:21.36,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Let's fight to our hearts' content!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:24.19,Main,ARACHNEKNIGHT,0,0,0,,You crazy devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.19,0:00:27.88,Main,ARACHNEKNIGHT,0,0,0,,We won't let you have our Forest of Ente!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:30.46,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,I like your spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:32.98,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Don't let me down, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.12,0:00:37.59,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Gellen got the best of the auxiliary gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.02,0:00:40.28,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,He'll get to kill lots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:43.02,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.27,0:00:49.34,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Huh, you came alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.58,0:00:53.28,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Oh, how you underestimate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.50,0:00:57.47,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,You can beg and cry to \Nbe killed all you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.47,0:01:00.25,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,but I won't be so quick to \Nput you out of your misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:03.65,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,I wasn't about to let \Nanyone else take you on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.05,0:01:06.67,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,I will make you wither myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.30,0:02:43.01,Ep_Title,EPTITLE,0,0,0,,{\fad(750,0)}The Battle of the Demonic Realm Portal
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.88,0:02:50.71,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Keep your distance and used ranged attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.83,0:02:53.03,Main,ELF1,0,0,0,,Energy Bolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:07.70,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,Hmph, you won't wound me \Nwith such meager attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.70,0:03:09.43,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,We know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.43,0:03:10.96,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Aim for the joints!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.30,0:03:13.89,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Fall back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.51,0:03:16.70,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Gaia Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.29,0:03:27.62,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.62,0:03:30.55,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,That was more powerful than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.23,0:03:32.27,Main,GIO/FIO,0,0,0,,Celina?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.61,0:03:36.52,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Why are you here? \NDidn't you head for the main gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.19,0:03:40.45,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I left it to Dolan and Chris.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.98,0:03:42.24,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:44.29,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,All our planning was for naught.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.22,0:03:52.61,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,This magic... The lamia from yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.17,0:03:57.16,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,That was a pretty powerful spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.26,0:04:02.84,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,You will be fun to devour.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:08.22,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,R-Right back at you. I'll be \Nthe one swallowing you whole!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.43,0:04:18.12,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Will Celina be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.12,0:04:21.39,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Every one of those demons \Nwere absurdly strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.16,0:04:24.45,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,I know she's with Gio's squad, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.72,0:04:28.12,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Honestly, I think it will be a rough battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.71,0:04:33.69,Flashback,CELINA,0,0,0,,I won't waver anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.09,0:04:41.11,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,But I also want to support \Nher effort to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.10,0:04:44.81,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,You really trust her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.16,0:04:49.30,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Regardless, I'm still worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.73,0:04:52.12,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Maybe I should go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.12,0:04:53.22,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.22,0:04:56.49,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I gave Celina a special magic crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.98,0:04:59.84,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,It will assist her in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.48,0:05:02.86,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Also, that girl is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.38,0:05:05.74,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Stronger than she believes, even.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.32,0:05:13.46,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.74,0:05:17.75,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,But no, I'm still worried!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.75,0:05:19.40,Main,DRIVER,0,0,0,,We're arriving at the next auxiliary gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.34,0:05:27.21,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Weak, far too weak! \NThis isn't very satisfying!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.79,0:05:54.05,Flashback,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Get off. I'll run the carriage into him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.05,0:05:55.58,Flashback,DRIVER,0,0,0,,G-Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.19,0:05:58.48,Flashback,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Dolan, you head for the \Nmain gate as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:06:00.28,Flashback,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Let me handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.65,0:06:01.62,Flashback,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.61,0:06:20.61,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Who goes there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.89,0:06:22.80,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,I will be your opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:25.43,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Are you unhurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.43,0:06:26.59,Main,ARACHNEKNIGHT3,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.59,0:06:28.26,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Look for a chance to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.26,0:06:31.46,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Take as many survivors with you as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.46,0:06:32.37,Main,ARACHNEKNIGHT3,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.03,0:06:37.77,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,So it's you, superhuman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:44.46,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,I wanted to fight that human \Nmale more, but you'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.06,0:06:48.02,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,I'll let Georg have him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.78,0:06:52.87,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,My apologies. But I'm in a hurry myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.97,0:06:56.86,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Awaken, El Spada!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.48,0:07:15.03,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Let's enjoy this battle of life and death,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.32,0:07:17.07,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,superhuman!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.93,0:07:25.79,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Oh? You're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.01,0:07:42.85,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Way to go, superhuman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.12,0:07:46.90,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,That again? I don't know anything \Nabout this superhuman malarkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.72,0:07:52.03,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I don't have to worry about Chris.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.40,0:07:56.04,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,But I want to minimize casualties \Namong all the troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.90,0:07:58.13,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I should hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.05,0:08:15.12,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,When will you deem it appropriate \Nto fight me yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.59,0:08:18.55,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Now should be a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.99,0:08:21.65,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Very well. I'll play with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.11,0:08:35.83,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,This will prevent any outside interference.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.31,0:08:38.86,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,We can go at it without worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.32,0:08:41.20,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,How thoughtful of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.17,0:08:48.71,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,You're trying to blow away my mist, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.09,0:08:51.93,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see you've learned. Very smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.59,0:08:53.86,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.04,0:09:00.86,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,I can also use the lives \NI've absorbed this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.35,0:09:10.37,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Did you just throw their life energy at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.50,0:09:14.04,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Life is all powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.47,0:09:16.73,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,You just have to use it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.68,0:09:18.85,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.92,0:09:35.19,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Well? Don't your friends' \Nlives make quite the impact?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.67,0:09:38.05,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Impressive, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.38,0:09:41.22,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.55,0:09:46.45,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,You'd better take their \Nlives into your arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:55.58,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,A mist that absorbs life energy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.21,0:09:58.22,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,It's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.22,0:10:03.35,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,I can absorb life energy while \Nsimultaneously using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.86,0:10:12.83,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Good. Resist with all you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.83,0:10:16.86,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,I want your suffering to \Nlast as long as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.86,0:10:19.65,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Because that brings me joy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.14,0:10:24.02,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,I'm not about to be your plaything!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.25,0:10:30.04,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,The color black absorbs \Nand embraces everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.61,0:10:36.36,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Roses with black petals are \Nflowers that bewitch all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.27,0:10:39.81,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Oh? Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.20,0:10:45.27,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,I had sealed this power away, \Nbut you are a worthy—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.27,0:10:50.77,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,no, a {\i1}filthy{\i0} enough opponent that \NI don't have to hold it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.58,0:10:56.65,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Ah, so you have the same power I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.02,0:11:01.17,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,How amusing. Time for a race, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.79,0:11:06.09,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Let's see who can absorb \Nthe other's life first!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.44,0:11:24.31,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,You were all talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.64,0:11:34.07,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,That's a nice look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.07,0:11:38.90,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,You came to challenge me alone, \Nand you'll wither away all alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.13,0:11:45.41,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,How does it feel to have your life \Nslowly seep out of your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.05,0:11:49.37,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,You've absorbed quite a lot of my life energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.06,0:11:53.86,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,It should be flowing all \Nthrough you by now, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.47,0:11:57.11,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,It feels incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.72,0:12:01.23,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Irresistibly delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.92,0:12:06.14,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,The spice of your hatred perfectly \Naccentuates the flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.14,0:12:08.88,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,I want to taste this every day if I could!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.20,0:12:13.26,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,I'm glad you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.26,0:12:17.11,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Because it's the last \Nthing you'll ever taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.11,0:12:19.87,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Enjoy it while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.59,0:12:23.42,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,What are you saying—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.69,0:12:31.51,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,What? Where's this pain coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.51,0:12:33.57,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,What the heck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.73,0:12:53.43,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Why are roses blooming from my body?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.43,0:12:57.21,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,This battle was decided \Nbefore we even began.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.45,0:12:59.64,Main - Top,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.64,0:13:04.93,Main - Top,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Ow! It hurts, it hurts, it hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.71,0:13:09.71,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Do you remember when I attacked you \Nwith a thorn in yesterday's battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.40,0:13:17.08,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,I sowed some tiny, tiny black \Nrose seeds in you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:21.61,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,You never expected an attack\Nto come from within, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.61,0:13:25.19,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Ah, no... How vexing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.19,0:13:28.22,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Don't suck my life away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.22,0:13:36.98,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,I am the princess of flowers, meant to \Nabsorb all life and bloom brilliantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.91,0:13:49.37,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,I managed to defeat her,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.37,0:13:53.71,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,but I don't think I could even beat \Na woodman sapling right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.65,0:13:57.00,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,This is bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:03.30,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Energy Rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.96,0:14:09.45,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.49,0:14:15.90,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Dolan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.37,0:14:24.67,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.41,0:14:27.67,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Why am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.32,0:14:30.62,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Celina? Celina!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.09,0:14:34.14,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,I-I just cast a spell...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.46,0:14:36.87,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,And then I blocked with Earth Shield...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.67,0:14:41.31,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Huh? I couldn't block it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.61,0:14:53.60,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Celestial Javelin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.55,0:15:03.11,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,You're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.56,0:15:05.79,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,What is this magic circle?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.79,0:15:08.02,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,One of defense and healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.40,0:15:13.29,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,As long as you're in it, it will heal you \Nand protect you from outside threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:15.15,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.71,0:15:20.18,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,I also owe you for your help earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.61,0:15:22.09,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.57,0:15:28.93,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,So you really aren't human.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.64,0:15:33.02,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Hm? Oh, you mean these?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.32,0:15:36.26,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I am human.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.73,0:15:41.70,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,It's just, I have my soul from \Nmy past life—that of a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.47,0:15:45.69,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,I've never even seen a real dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.69,0:15:49.66,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,and here I'm meeting one reborn first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.47,0:15:55.60,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,You should lie down for a while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.60,0:15:58.13,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,I don't have the time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.60,0:16:02.84,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I know. So I'm sorry, \Nbut I'll be going ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.17,0:16:04.91,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.91,0:16:08.19,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I'm going to fly there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.19,0:16:09.57,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,You probably wouldn't\N be able keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.52,0:16:14.98,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,I can go with you, if you carry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.92,0:16:20.81,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Frankly, I'd find it easier \Nto fight Georg by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.30,0:16:25.08,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,How cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.20,0:16:30.13,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Not that I need to worry about \Nyou, but please do take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.13,0:16:32.63,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Thanks, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.63,0:16:36.22,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I'm worried \Nabout when it comes to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.22,0:16:40.14,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Take care not to use too much of \Nyour power and destroy the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.64,0:16:45.13,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Very well. I'll be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.40,0:16:51.32,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,I wish you luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.70,0:16:59.35,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,That's right. Don't let him get any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.35,0:17:01.04,Main,ELFWOMAN,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.46,0:17:04.94,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Celina! You'll be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.53,0:17:06.99,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Fio?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.49,0:17:10.38,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Why does she sound so worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.92,0:17:15.20,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Huh? I feel really...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.77,0:17:22.55,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Don't look, Celina!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.55,0:17:23.85,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.85,0:17:26.29,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Yeah, hold her down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.29,0:17:35.11,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,I'll cast a painkilling spell on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.23,0:17:45.07,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,No way... Celina, you can use healing magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.07,0:17:47.65,Main,ELFMALE,0,0,0,,Hey, he's getting closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.65,0:17:48.77,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.64,0:17:53.93,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Listen well, Celina.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.33,0:17:57.32,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Keep going straight, \Nand you'll exit the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.78,0:17:58.81,Main,CLEINA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.81,0:18:01.22,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Keep going straight, and don't look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.22,0:18:02.88,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,We want you to escape at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.39,0:18:07.44,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Escape by myself? I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.69,0:18:10.63,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Please. I don't want you to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.04,0:18:12.46,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,So run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.94,0:18:18.60,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Eat this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.63,0:18:36.86,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,How many more cuts must\N I make to take you down?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.17,0:18:41.67,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,That's a superhuman for you. \NYour abilities are no joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.07,0:18:45.62,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Seriously, what are you talking \Nabout? What is a superhuman?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.07,0:18:50.53,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,What? Are they not well-known \Nin the human realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.72,0:18:57.93,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,I see how it is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.68,0:19:01.50,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.50,0:19:08.95,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Superhumans are monsters that are born\N among the frail humans in rare instances.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.28,0:19:14.62,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,They are superior to ordinary humans \Nin power, magic, and intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.77,0:19:21.81,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,And the humans can't stand having \Nsuch extraordinary people around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.57,0:19:25.23,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Of course they'd ostracize them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.65,0:19:28.11,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,What would you know, demon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.47,0:19:31.65,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Oh? Did that strike a nerve?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.62,0:19:37.79,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Superhumans were our natural enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.24,0:19:42.66,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Despite being mere humans, \Nthey've killed demons, fallen gods,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.66,0:19:46.83,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,and even the most powerful ancient dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.69,0:19:54.56,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,That's right. The hero who \Nkilled the ancient dragon...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.35,0:19:58.65,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,He was a superhuman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.25,0:20:06.63,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.73,0:20:16.44,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,I never expected to be able \Nto fight one of them myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.22,0:20:21.61,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,So I'm one of those spoken of in that song.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.16,0:20:27.30,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Now show me your hero's power!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.17,0:20:31.24,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,You have my thanks. \NYou've helped me understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.72,0:20:33.25,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,This power of mine...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.87,0:20:38.11,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,exists to defeat the likes of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.97,0:20:56.49,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,So this is what a hero is capable of...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.49,0:21:03.00,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,I wonder how the dragon felt when \Nhe was killed by such a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.24,0:21:11.81,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,It's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.46,0:21:15.61,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,The dragon counted the \Nhero among his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.20,0:21:18.68,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,And that friend betrayed his trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.12,0:21:22.48,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,He must resent him for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.75,0:21:30.44,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Ever since I saw my former master, \NWar God Ardes, and you fight together,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.44,0:21:34.38,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,I have wanted to cross swords with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.78,0:21:37.52,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,A battle addict that fell \Ninto the demonic realm, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.85,0:21:43.06,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,You dare to challenge me, knowing who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.79,0:21:47.22,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,As I must, as a wicked spirit \Nobsessed with life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.73,0:21:51.35,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Perish lamenting your own powerlessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.76,0:21:58.46,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Now that you are reborn as a human,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.46,0:22:04.85,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,my sword may be able to \Npierce through your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.80,0:22:13.09,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Surely you cannot use your\N full power in these lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.70,0:22:14.77,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.24,0:22:19.14,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Allow me to guide you to our demonic realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.99,0:24:00.00,Next_Episode,SIGN,0,0,0,,Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.89,0:24:07.88,Main,AIRI,0,0,0,,This week's lucky item is black rose!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.88,0:24:09.69,Main,AIRI,0,0,0,,Look forward to next time!
